1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,620
The missing voice arrived at the end of a long afternoon, when two of the seven families on the list had not been visited, and five had.

2
00:00:08,620 --> 00:00:14,249
“I am probably one of the eight you decided to skip,” the woman said.

3
00:00:14,249 --> 00:00:20,239
“Thirty years I have watched this river, and I can sing you its fifty moods.

4
00:00:20,239 --> 00:00:25,878
Recall the last chart: it was made on the other side.”

5
00:00:25,878 --> 00:00:33,887
She proposed that the questionnaire contain a page for what people remembered, not only for what they could count.

6
00:00:33,887 --> 00:00:45,500
Forty minutes later, sixty of her neighbours had signed it, and the struggle to generate fifteen more signatures turned into a small festival.

7
00:00:45,500 --> 00:01:01,617
“You accuse us of being tired,” she said, “and you are nineteen years late with the eighty questions you want answered.” A ninety-year-old man with an eleven-metre rope said he could still accomplish more than the drone overhead.

8
00:01:01,617 --> 00:01:05,427
“Do not yell at the water,” he added.

9
00:01:05,427 --> 00:01:08,226
“Listen to it.”

10
00:01:08,226 --> 00:01:14,266
The chart she drew had eighteen lines, and one of them was a cattle path.

11
00:01:14,266 --> 00:01:31,398
“A globe is not a questionnaire,” she said, “and a preacher is not a hydrologist.” The surplus of data in the station did not include the dialect of the river; the refrain of her account was the same every year.

12
00:01:31,398 --> 00:01:35,878
It was difficult to quantify a scarcity of trust.

13
00:01:35,878 --> 00:01:47,711
A smoky skyline, a separatist slogan on a wall, and a pushy official with a clipboard: the group had to innovate or admit the place was not reparable.

14
00:01:47,711 --> 00:01:56,699
“Take the activity and the place together,” Lin wrote, “and you have the only sustainable measure we have.”

15
00:01:56,699 --> 00:02:05,398
The director sent the drive with the recordings back to the lab and asked the team to bring the same energy to the field next week.

16
00:02:05,398 --> 00:02:16,356
Its power would come from the people who lived on the bank, the different situation of each family, and a make of evidence that even a ten-year-old could follow.

17
00:02:16,356 --> 00:02:27,389
The reader who was seventy and the child who was eleven sang the refrain together; the oldest was ninety, and he preached the same lesson without a pulpit.

18
00:02:27,389 --> 00:02:36,243
The dialect of the river was the only chart that mattered, and ten people had to strive against a scarce supply of patience.

19
00:02:36,243 --> 00:02:40,407
As a force, it did not involve the state.

20
00:02:40,407 --> 00:02:47,756
The cattle, the globe, and the skyline were all part of the same questionnaire.
